# Debug artifacts and one-off probe scripts.
# artifacts/ holds ad-hoc diagnostic output (*.out, *.err, diag*.ps1);
# tests/test_*.ps1 are throwaway sqlite3 quoting/parameter probes kept
# only while the bug they investigate is being fixed.
# Formal suites are named MusicServer.*.Tests.ps1 and are NOT ignored.
artifacts/
test.py
tests/_reload_probe/
tests/phase3_root/
